## 7. Common Pitfalls and Solutions

### 7.1 Armenian-Specific

| Pitfall | Wrong | Correct |
|---------|-------|---------|
| Truncated lemmas | `բժշկ` | `բժիշկ` |
| Unmarked genitive possession | `{"case": "genitive", "possessed": false}` | `{"case": "genitive", "possessed": true, "possessor": "3sg"}` |
| Possessor mismatch | Մարդկանց վստահությունը → `possessor: "3sg"` | `possessor: "3pl"` |
| Missing definite possession | `գիրքը` → `possessed: false` | `possessed: true, possessor: "3sg"` |

### 7.2 Greek Noun-Specific

| Pitfall | Wrong | Correct |
|---------|-------|---------|
| Ancient declensions | `"third_ancient"` | `"third"` (Modern system) |
| Over-marking irregular | πατέρας → `irregular: true` | `irregular: false` |
| Plural-based stems | πείραμα → `πειράματ-` | `πειραματ-` (from singular) |
| False compounds | συμμετοχή → `compound: true` | `compound: false` |
| Multiword stems | κινητό τηλέφωνο → `κινητοτηλεφων-` | *(empty string)* |

### 7.3 Greek Verb-Specific

| Pitfall | Wrong | Correct |
|---------|-------|---------|
| Missing subjunctive features | `να τρέχω` → `person: null` | `person: 1, number: "Sing"` |
| Confusing voice & diathesis | έρχομαι → `voice: Act` | `voice: Pass, diathesis: Neutral` |
| Wrong conjugation class | θέλω → `-ώ` | `-ω` |
| Non-existent imperative | `mood: Imp, person: 3` | Imperatives are 2nd person only |

